<title>USA: TABLE - Pease Oil Q2 loss widens.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Pease Oil Q2 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>GRAND JUNCTION, Colo. 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q2			Six Months</p>
<p>			    1997	 1996	   1997	 1996</p>
<p> Revenues	   $996,000 $1,640,000   $2,215,000 $4,019,000</p>
<p> Net Loss	  (635,000)  (196,000)  (1,149,000)   (46,000)</p>
<p>Net Loss Applicable</p>
<p>to Common</p>
<p>  Stockholders   (680,000)  (247,000)  (1,239,000)  (147,000)</p>
<p> Earnings per Share  (.05)	(.03)	  (.11)	(.02)</p>
<p>Weight Average Shares</p>
<p>  Outstanding   12,622,000  7,262,000   10,781,000  7,226,000</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said decreased income in the current quarter is the result of lower commodity prices in the Rockies and expansion efforts in the Gulf coast.</p>
<p>Full name is Pease Oil and Gas Co.</p>
</text>
